sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff as Front-desk staff
    participant UI as Front-desk UI
    participant ReservationService
    participant AvailabilityService
    participant DB as Hotel database
    participant Audit as Audit log

    Staff->>UI: Enter guest, dates, occupancy, room type
    UI->>ReservationService: createReservation(request)
    ReservationService->>AvailabilityService: findAvailableRooms(dates, type)
    AvailabilityService->>DB: Query rooms, reservations, maintenance blocks
    DB-->>AvailabilityService: Candidate rooms
    AvailabilityService-->>ReservationService: Available rooms

    alt No available room
        ReservationService-->>UI: Reject with availability error
        UI-->>Staff: Show alternatives or change dates
    else Room available
        ReservationService->>DB: Begin transaction
        ReservationService->>DB: Create guest if needed
        ReservationService->>DB: Create reservation
        ReservationService->>DB: Create room assignment
        ReservationService->>DB: Commit transaction
        ReservationService->>Audit: Record reservation created
        ReservationService-->>UI: Confirmation code and reservation
        UI-->>Staff: Show confirmation
    end

    Staff->>UI: Select arriving reservation and check in
    UI->>ReservationService: checkIn(reservationId)
    ReservationService->>DB: Lock reservation and assigned room
    ReservationService->>DB: Verify status and room readiness
    alt Invalid state or room not ready
        DB-->>ReservationService: Validation failure
        ReservationService-->>UI: Reject check-in with reason
    else Ready
        ReservationService->>DB: Set reservation Checked-in
        ReservationService->>DB: Set room Occupied
        ReservationService->>Audit: Record check-in
        ReservationService-->>UI: Check-in successful
        UI-->>Staff: Show room and guest details
    end
